# Code by AkinoAlice@TyrantRey
# The build context is what the Dockerfile copies and nothing else: no
# checkout state, no local venv, no local UI build, no roots.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!docker/
!Frontend/
Frontend/node_modules/
Frontend/dist/
Frontend/coverage/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[co]
